{"Lithuanian bundle contains an Italian sentence ('Installa una delle...') which looks like an accidental copy/paste and makes the UI inconsistent for lt users.": 0.9865137934684753, "zh_CN bundle line uses Traditional Chinese characters/wording (\u624b\u6a5f/\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f). For zh_CN it should be Simplified Chinese to stay consistent with the rest of the file.": 0.9291333556175232, "Method name has a typo: santizeAnchors -> sanitizeAnchors. Keeping the typo makes the intent harder to read/search for.": 0.7886311411857605, "The anchor-mismatch error message omits the key and file, which makes it hard to pinpoint the problematic translation when this fails in CI. Include key+file context in the message.": 0.7573197484016418, "The HTML body contains what looks like a stray 'n' prefix ('<p>nHvis ...'). This reads like a typo and shows up in the rendered email.": 0.659582257270813, "HTML email text contains likely typos ('tao' -> 'tai', 'nJei' -> 'Jei', 'ignuoruokite' -> 'ignoruokite'). Since this line is being modified anyway, it's a good opportunity to fix them.": 0.5835033059120178, "Changing placeholders to single-brace MessageFormat/ICU syntax ({0}, {2,choice,...}) in files consumed by i18next (default {{...}} interpolation) will not be interpolated and will likely be shown verbatim to users. Keep the existing i18next placeholder style or implement i18next pluralization via separate *_one/*_other keys.": 0.9443668723106384, "verifySafeHtml() throws RuntimeException on IO errors, which bypasses the plugin's MojoExecutionException flow and produces an inconsistent failure mode.": 0.7479183673858643, "Deriving the English bundle path via replaceAll() is regex-based and not anchored, which can produce wrong paths for filenames that contain underscores (e.g. some_key_en.properties). Prefer replacing only a locale suffix at the end.": 0.7649030685424805}